Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.88,0:00:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the heck am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.16,0:00:11.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A lake?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.42,0:00:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.08,0:00:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.22,0:00:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.58,0:00:24.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.66,0:00:28.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I don't do something, that\Nvending machine's in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.84,0:00:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was sure I'd die from a fall like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.22,0:00:38.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I guess I survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.32,0:00:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, first things first.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.78,0:00:42.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.96,0:00:43.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.06,0:00:45.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can't I move?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.32,0:00:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone help me, please! Hello there! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.60,0:00:50.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I hear my own voice just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.52,0:00:51.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, calm down
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.74,0:00:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yup, that's my voice!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.42,0:01:00.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you\Nagain I recognize this spiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.88,0:01:03.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard those words countless times.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.08,0:01:05.29,sign_1513_19_Kokuuma_Cream_of,text,0,0,0,,Kokuuma Cream of Corn Soup
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.28,0:01:04.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could even win a reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.18,0:01:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a huge fan of any\Nand all vending machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.84,0:01:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone knows they're my passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.64,0:01:12.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd never mistake that sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.12,0:01:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.44,0:01:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For some reason, I've been\Nturned into a vending machine!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.85,0:01:24.98,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(773,1)}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N{\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.06,0:01:29.31,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(100,65)\fad(734,1)}The Vending Machine Travels
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.06,0:01:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I died and have been\Nreborn as a vending machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.86,0:01:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,machine huh as if that could happen no
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.44,0:01:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,matter how obsessed i was there's no way
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.14,0:01:41.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i could turn into one whoa this is awesome
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.68,0:01:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's no other way to explain it i am\Na vending machine i'm fully stocked with
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.76,0:01:51.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,reasonably priced goods and my new\Nrectangular body is the perfect combination of
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.09,0:01:53.80,sign_2664_34_Megumi_Natural_W,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(195,20)\fad(500,1)}Megumi Natural Water
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.34,0:01:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,elegance and functionality hold on a sec\Nthis can't be happening becoming a vending
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.50,0:02:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,machine is the worst or is it being reborn
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.44,0:02:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as the thing i loved could this be some
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.64,0:02:10.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sort of gift from the divine well there's\Nno changing what i am now not sure what
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.76,0:02:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it says about me or my fandom that i've\Njust accepted this hello there thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.28,0:02:17.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.30,0:02:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.74,0:02:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could even win a reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.82,0:02:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad. You win!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.34,0:02:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please insert coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.76,0:02:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are those phrases all I can say?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.70,0:02:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what else I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.32,0:02:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a vending machine.\NFocus. Become it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.66,0:02:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely you can operate yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.52,0:02:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.12,0:02:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Understand it.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:38.92,0:02:40.18,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(280,1)}(Cold) Mineral Water ¥130 100-count\N (Warm) Corn Soup ¥100 100-count
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.04,0:02:41.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, in my brain!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.44,0:02:42.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I don't have a brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.62,0:02:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A bunch of text and numbers\Npopped up in my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.40,0:02:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are these the goods I have for sale?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.68,0:03:00.78,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(280,1)}(Cold) Mineral Water ¥130 100-count\N (Warm) Corn Soup ¥100 100-count
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.48,0:02:49.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are only two types.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.80,0:02:54.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can use your points to\Nchange your current inventory.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.11,0:03:00.78,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text,0,0,0,,<Function> Keep Cold • Keep Warm
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.44,0:02:55.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.35,0:02:58.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I can change what I'm\Nselling? Points, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.80,0:03:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That must be what PT stands for.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.94,0:03:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The money you earn is\Nconverted into points.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.52,0:03:07.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may spend points to replenish or\Nmake changes to your stocked goods,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.36,0:03:09.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as well as acquire new functions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.72,0:03:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.66,0:03:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did some investigating on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.88,0:03:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems spending points not only\Nlets me keep items hot or cold,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.72,0:03:20.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it also lets me do things\Nlike heat up frozen food?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.26,0:03:23.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and even add hot water\Nto cup ramen on demand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.62,0:03:25.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might as well test\Nout my other functions
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.72,0:03:28.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and check out what kind\Nof items I can sell.
