Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.44,0:03:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it looks like I have everything I could\Nbuy from the vending machines back home.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.60,0:03:39.57,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (top to bottom),0,0,0,,{\an7\bord4\c&HA2797D&}(Cold) Mineral Water\N(Warm) Corn Soup\N{\c&HFFFFFF&}(Warm) Sweet Sake\N(Warm) Canned Oden\N(Cold) Milk Tea\N(Warm) Milk Tea
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.82,0:03:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's try spending 10 points to switch\None of my items to cold milk tea.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.57,0:03:40.28,sign_2664_34_Megumi_Natural_W,text,0,0,0,,{\fs25\t(316,710,\c&HFDFFBF&\3c&HFDFFBF&)}Megumi Natural Water
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.50,0:03:42.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It worked.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.53,0:03:43.28,sign_2664_34_Megumi_Natural_W,text,0,0,0,,{\fs25\c&H9B6444&\3c&HE7B195&}Kocha Kadan
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.58,0:03:44.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk about convenient.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.32,0:03:46.74,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (very bottom),0,0,0,,<Function> Keep Cold • Keep Warm
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.26,0:03:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,100 yen is a good price.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.84,0:03:46.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It says here.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.74,0:03:49.29,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (very bottom),0,0,0,,{\fs18}\N(Cold) Mineral Water ¥130 100-count\N(Warm) Corn Soup ¥100 100-count\N(Cold) Milk Tea ¥100 100-count
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.92,0:03:48.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can turn 100 yen into one point.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.98,0:03:50.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.18,0:03:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to see what else I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.08,0:03:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After experimenting a little bit more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.84,0:03:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I realized one important thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.08,0:04:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My new body doesn't run on electricity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.38,0:04:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead it seems I consume\Npoints to keep myself powered on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.12,0:04:07.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I use one point an hour.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.47,0:04:08.18,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(195,55)\fsp6\fad(443,308)}Hour
