Dialogue: 1,0:04:07.89,0:04:10.39,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text,0,0,0,,{\an2\fsp6\fad(443,308)\pos(220,175)}Points
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.04,0:04:14.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means I have to sell at least\N2400 yen worth of product every day.
