Dialogue: 1,0:04:12.23,0:04:15.40,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (right),0,0,0,,{\fad(230,1)\pos(270,160)}Yen
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.06,0:04:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still have nearly a thousand points.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:15.40,0:04:18.11,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text,0,0,0,,{\fs25}<Function> Keep Cold • Keep Warm
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.68,0:04:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I can run for about a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.48,0:04:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I shouldn't waste any points\Nuntil I can get a steady income.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.20,0:04:24.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.60,0:04:28.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will I actually get\Nany customers out here?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:34.04,0:04:37.96,sign_6571_118_The_Next_Day,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,280)\fad(442,767)}The Next Day
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.24,0:04:35.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody's come by!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.52,0:04:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I'm doing is losing points here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.42,0:04:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this keeps up, I won't make\Nenough and I'll run out of juice!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.32,0:04:41.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.54,0:04:46.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A frog?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.66,0:04:48.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's almost as big as a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.56,0:04:51.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, it's wearing armor\Nand holding a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.78,0:04:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I should probably\Nbe a little more surprised,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.96,0:04:59.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but turning into a vending machine\Nkind of one-ups this. oh hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.94,0:05:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,uh um hi there
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.78,0:05:08.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hold on stop
Dialogue: 1,0:05:10.91,0:05:14.29,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(140,200)\fad(192,1)\frx0\fry23}3 damage!\N Durability decreased by 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.04,0:05:14.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,three damage durability\Nhas been decreased by
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.20,0:05:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,three what's durability\Nif your durability is
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.88,0:05:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,exhausted the vending\Nmachine will break and become
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.44,0:05:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,unusable so it's like hit\Npoints in a video Okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.86,0:05:25.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how many do I have left?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:25.47,0:05:31.39,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (left column; top to bottom),0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(185,100)\fs15}Durability
Dialogue: 1,0:05:25.47,0:05:31.39,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (left column; top to bottom),0,0,0,,{\an4\fs15\pos(160,135)}Toughness
Dialogue: 1,0:05:25.47,0:05:31.39,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (left column; top to bottom),0,0,0,,{\an4\fs15\pos(160,170)}Strength
Dialogue: 1,0:05:25.47,0:05:31.39,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (left column; top to bottom),0,0,0,,{\an4\fs15\pos(180,210)}Speed
Dialogue: 1,0:05:25.47,0:05:31.39,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (left column; top to bottom),0,0,0,,{\an4\fs15\pos(180,245)}Dexterity
Dialogue: 1,0:05:25.47,0:05:31.39,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (left column; top to bottom),0,0,0,,{\an4\fs15\pos(160,285)}Magic
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.84,0:05:26.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.86,0:05:28.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These must be my stats.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.42,0:05:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything but durability\Nand toughness is zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.32,0:05:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose a vending machine\Ndoesn't need those stats.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.78,0:05:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.50,0:05:38.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does magic exist in this world?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.84,0:05:42.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can spend points in order\Nto restore your durability.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.42,0:05:43.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.33,0:05:45.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still have about 900 points left.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.24,0:05:46.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I can get through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.14,0:05:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh crap, this is really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.26,0:05:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to get hit by that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.56,0:05:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There has to be some sort of\Nself-defense function in here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.08,0:05:57.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.37,0:06:00.13,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\3c&H45110E&}Pour Hot Water
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.22,0:06:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pour hot water, transaction\Nfanfare, big winner roulette.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:58.29,0:06:00.83,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\3c&H45110E&}2L Support
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.25,0:06:01.21,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (top),0,0,0,,{\an7\3c&H45110E&}Switch Design
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.25,0:06:01.21,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (bottom),0,0,0,,{\an7\3c&H45110E&}Transaction Fanfare
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.04,0:06:01.71,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\3c&H45110E&}Boxed Goods Support
Dialogue: 1,0:06:01.08,0:06:03.05,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\3c&H45110E&}Big Winner Roulette
Dialogue: 1,0:06:01.59,0:06:03.42,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\3c&H45110E&}Change Paint Color
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.80,0:06:03.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't use any of these!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:02.92,0:06:05.63,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\3c&H45110E&}Vending Compartment Shock Absorber
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.34,0:06:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, there's got to be something\NI can do to get out of this!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:03.88,0:06:06.30,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\3c&H45110E&}Add Markings
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.04,0:06:07.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.34,0:06:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Durability has been decreased by two.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.08,0:06:10.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.99,0:06:12.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need help each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.10,0:06:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Durability has been decreased by four.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:14.14,0:06:21.98,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text,0,0,0,,{\fs18\move(315,160,320,85,1235,3111)\an2\t(1234,3111,\fs40)}Blessing
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.24,0:06:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blessing? What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.32,0:06:18.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a special power granted by a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.52,0:06:20.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may acquire a\Nblessing without spending
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.74,0:06:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,any of your points I\Ndon't really understand,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.46,0:06:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's some sort of magic, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.40,0:06:29.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's do it Can I even use\Nswordsmanship or martial arts?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.82,0:06:30.03,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (left column; top to bottom),0,0,0,,{\an7\bord4\fs15}Visual Field Shift\NTelepathy\NAbsorption\NRobbery\NSwordsmanship\NMartial Arts\NBad Luck
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.82,0:06:30.03,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (middle column; top to bottom),0,0,0,,{\an7\bord4\pos(250,20)\fs15}???\NRelocation\NSummoning\NNecromancy\NPseudo-Life Creation\N ???\N ???\N ???
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.82,0:06:30.03,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (right column; top to bottom),0,0,0,,{\an7\bord4\fs15\pos(460,20)}Erudition\NEducation\NMemory Power\NDurability\NOriginality\NTaste Insensitivity\NMakeup\NAttentive Listening
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.02,0:06:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last time I checked I don't\Nhave any arms or legs.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:30.07,0:06:32.57,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (top line),0,0,0,,{\an1\fs10\pos(60,70)}2 damage!\N Durability decreased by 2.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:30.32,0:06:32.57,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (top line),0,0,0,,{\an1\fs10\pos(56,182)}3 damage!\N{\alphaFF\t(1028,1029,\alpha00)} Durability decreased by 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.14,0:06:33.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There has to be something else
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.57,0:06:34.53,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (top line),0,0,0,,{\an1\fs10\pos(60,70)\fad(1,262)}3 damage!\N Durability decreased by 3.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.57,0:06:34.53,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (top line),0,0,0,,{\an1\fs10\pos(56,182)\fad(1,262)}5 damage!\N{\alphaFF\t(1028,1029,\alpha00)}  Durability decreased by 5.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:34.53,0:06:40.96,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text,0,0,0,,{\frz-19.36\an2\fs40\pos(355,95)}Barrier
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.48,0:06:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Barrier deploys an invisible\Nbarrier around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.38,0:06:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can designate what\Nobjects are allowed through.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.96,0:06:42.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I picked that one
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.72,0:06:51.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could even win a reward!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.04,0:06:52.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.50,0:06:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behold the invincible vending machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.06,0:06:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.66,0:07:00.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.44,0:07:00.98,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text,0,0,0,,{\frz9.46\fax-0.12\pos(316,260)\frx358\fry2}Points reduced by 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.57,0:07:01.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.73,0:07:00.98,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text,0,0,0,,{\frz9.46\fax-0.12\frx358\fry2\pos(319,282)}Points reduced by 1.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.85,0:07:00.98,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text,0,0,0,,{\frz9.46\fax-0.12\pos(323,305)\frx348\fry8}Points reduced by 1.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.98,0:07:04.69,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord4\fs25}Points reduced by 1.\NPoints reduced by 1.\NPoints reduced by 1.\NPoints reduced by 1.\NPoints reduced by 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.49,0:07:04.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come I'm losing so\Nmany points so quickly?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.54,0:07:05.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.80,0:07:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give it up, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.34,0:07:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you're doing is wasting\Nyour time and my points!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.00,0:07:15.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whew!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.91,0:07:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.30,0:07:19.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might as well get my\Ndurability back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.02,0:07:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There. Good as new.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.88,0:07:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got 311 points left.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.54,0:07:28.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can still last over 10 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.02,0:07:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But unless somebody buys something, my\Npoints will dry up and I'll run out of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.74,0:07:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what happens after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.42,0:07:35.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will I die?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.48,0:07:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a tragically short life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.10,0:07:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or, I suppose, a short operating\Ntime? Somebody! Anybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.26,0:07:42.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please help me!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.90,0:07:48.82,sign_6571_118_The_Next_Day,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,280)\fad(442,767)}Several Days Later...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.62,0:07:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would have been pretty cool to\Nsell at least one thing before dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.98,0:07:52.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no use trying to hide from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.34,0:08:02.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.25,0:08:04.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could have sworn they were around here
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.04,0:08:07.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness, I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.92,0:08:11.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so hungry I can't\Nmuster up any strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.56,0:08:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does this kind of\Nthing always happen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.04,0:08:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I even dropped my bag\Nwith all my food in it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.52,0:08:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.68,0:08:19.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have listened!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.04,0:08:23.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My parents were right, I'm\Nnot cut out to be a hunter!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.36,0:08:24.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's she talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.96,0:08:27.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to defeat frog\Nfiends for their meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.80,0:08:28.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For some reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.71,0:08:32.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my attacks don't hit when I'm by\Nmyself and I just want to take a nap!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.62,0:08:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things will be better if\NI at least add some food.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.24,0:08:37.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.14,0:08:41.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.32,0:08:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like some kind of stone\Nmonument, but too Middle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.46,0:08:46.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The shape is really peculiar, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:46.67,0:08:51.76,sign_2664_34_Megumi_Natural_W,text,0,0,0,,{\fs25\c&H884332&\3c&HBAA842&}Megumi Natural Water
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.92,0:08:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And are those drinks behind the glass?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.32,0:08:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a bunch of writing,\Nbut I can't read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.96,0:08:52.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.92,0:08:55.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what was that voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.42,0:08:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd it come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.40,0:08:58.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please insert coins. The box.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.36,0:08:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is it talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.88,0:09:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, coins? It wants money?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.14,0:09:03.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would a copper coin work?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.94,0:09:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it has to be at least silver.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.32,0:09:07.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if it needs gold?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.10,0:09:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As if I even had that on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.68,0:09:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It said something about\Ninserting the coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.22,0:09:16.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it can't hurt to put in\Na copper and see what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.76,0:09:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like a copper coin\Nwasn't enough after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.18,0:09:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is an unsupported currency.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.20,0:09:27.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you acquire the coin conversion\Nfunction, you can accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.14,0:09:27.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.05,0:09:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.97,0:09:29.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on just one second.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:29.33,0:09:32.00,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text,0,0,0,,{\an2\fay.25\fs25\pos(290,30)}Coin Conversion
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.88,0:09:30.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, there it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.92,0:09:32.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can swing 100 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.08,0:09:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't increase the prices, but\Nthe numbers went up all the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.12,0:09:37.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.03,0:09:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did the number change?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.04,0:09:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A thousand owa?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.56,0:09:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, but that's a whole silver coin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.18,0:09:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this world's unit of\Ncurrency is called an owa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.34,0:09:48.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's expensive, but I\Nneed food for my belly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.64,0:09:53.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm about to beg!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.48,0:09:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It lit up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.12,0:09:59.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, does it want me to push something?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.86,0:10:00.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.77,0:10:02.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, there's a picture of soup on here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.22,0:10:04.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.70,0:10:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something came out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.36,0:10:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not gonna chomp down if\NI reach my hand in, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.60,0:10:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.84,0:10:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So hurry up and take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.24,0:10:15.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I highly recommend this\Nbrand of corn soup!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:19.01,0:10:21.43,sign_1513_19_Kokuuma_Cream_of,text,0,0,0,,{\c&HD9F0F4&\3c&H4F78E8&}Kokuuma Cream of Corn Soup
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.08,0:10:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's so warm!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.04,0:10:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, do I twist the top to open it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.40,0:10:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.31,0:10:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It smells good!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.98,0:10:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.24,0:10:36.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.40,0:10:37.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't want Mrs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.56,0:10:40.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to hear this, but it's way better\Nthan the food I had in town!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.06,0:10:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do I feel so happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.18,0:10:47.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Helping someone out gives me a sense\Nof satisfaction I haven't felt before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.72,0:10:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, man, I drank everything already.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.88,0:10:54.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet the other stuff\Nin there is tasty, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.72,0:10:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The clear-looking ones are probably water,\NAnd I already know what that tastes like,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.26,0:11:01.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I'll try out the\Nlight brown drink next.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.74,0:11:05.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems she took a liking\Nto the milk tea as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.08,0:11:10.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Afterwards, she bought three more corn\Nsoups, along with a bottle of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.60,0:11:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I earned six silver coins and 30\Ncoppers for a total of 6,300 owa,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.88,0:11:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which means I got back 63 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.44,0:11:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A full stomach must have broken\Nthe tension she was holding.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.38,0:11:29.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As soon as she finished\Neating, she fell asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.78,0:11:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's a bit of an odd one,\Nbut she's my best customer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.12,0:11:33.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.06,0:11:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll keep you safe with my barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.02,0:11:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The trash cleans itself up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.76,0:11:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to be the most advanced\Nvending machine in this other world!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.62,0:11:51.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like I fell asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.44,0:11:54.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's a good thing\Nno monsters showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.86,0:11:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I ended up spending a whole bunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.28,0:11:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm feeling a lot better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.16,0:12:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's all thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.98,0:12:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.80,0:12:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.04,0:12:05.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.72,0:12:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.88,0:12:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I forgot that you can talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.74,0:12:12.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.78,0:12:15.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you only able to say certain phrases?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.42,0:12:19.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I actually know someone who's inventing\Ntools that have magical power inside them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.62,0:12:21.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if you're something similar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.90,0:12:25.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can understand what I'm saying,\Nthen I'd like it if you said something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.90,0:12:26.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.81,0:12:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.76,0:12:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.18,0:12:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet Hulemy would be\Ninterested in meeting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.84,0:12:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I haven't told you my name yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.64,0:12:37.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can call me Lamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.00,0:12:38.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.28,0:12:40.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has a nice ring to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.92,0:12:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.00,0:12:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's this sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.04,0:12:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whenever you want to say yes,\Nyou can just say hello there,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.78,0:12:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we'll use a different\Nphrase to mean no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.04,0:12:48.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.10,0:12:52.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, is that what you\Nwant to use for know then?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.58,0:12:54.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there. Yes, huh? Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.22,0:12:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.16,0:12:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you tell me your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.54,0:12:59.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.10,0:13:00.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.01,0:13:03.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what are you doing out here all alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.52,0:13:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you on some sort of\Nimportant quest? Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.88,0:13:08.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope I'm not being too forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.16,0:13:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you lonely by yourself? Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.86,0:13:14.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought that was the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.88,0:13:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For some reason you looked lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.78,0:13:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would it be okay with you if\NI moved you somewhere else?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.90,0:13:21.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.84,0:13:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.18,0:13:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was thinking about bringing you\Nback and showing you to Hewla me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.84,0:13:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet the two of you would\Nhit it off right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.58,0:13:30.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.70,0:13:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're cool with it? Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.70,0:13:33.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me just a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.26,0:13:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Up we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.92,0:13:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.26,0:13:40.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to weigh at least 500 kilograms!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.02,0:13:43.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, you're heavier than you look.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.98,0:13:54.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for saving me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.72,0:14:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently, Lamas has a blessing\Ncalled the blessing of might.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.04,0:14:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose that explains why\Nshe's so incredibly strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.20,0:14:09.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just going to take a short break here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.14,0:14:11.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to get hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.30,0:14:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if I can buy more\Nof that tasty yellow soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.26,0:14:18.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thing is, corn soup\Nisn't all that filling.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.42,0:14:20.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, what else could I stock?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.38,0:14:21.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, how about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.20,0:14:26.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.11,0:14:26.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That surprised me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.24,0:14:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are glowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.60,0:14:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you change your items?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.70,0:14:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.98,0:14:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it be food?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.14,0:14:34.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.05,0:14:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought it might be!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.62,0:14:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the same price.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.50,0:14:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll buy some.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.24,0:14:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, what a weird texture!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.88,0:14:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing I can really taste is\Nsalt, but I can't stop eating them!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.20,0:14:54.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, no, no! No,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.98,0:14:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna burn through the\Nrest of my money at this rate,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.62,0:14:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I can't control myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.82,0:15:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to that, I'm back up to 320 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.64,0:15:07.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next, I want to try to adjust\Nthe price of mineral water.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:07.71,0:15:09.63,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (top),0,0,0,,{\an1\fs40\pos(70,70)\fsp6}Mineral Water
Dialogue: 1,0:15:07.71,0:15:09.63,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (bottom),0,0,0,,{\an1\fs40\fsp6\pos(530,200)}owa
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.14,0:15:13.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'd be great if I could offer it for\Nless, but my life kind of depends on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.00,0:15:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should reach the entrance of this\Nstratum soon stratum after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.12,0:15:21.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll take a break in a nearby village
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.34,0:15:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait Lamas, you're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.52,0:15:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Karios and Gorth boy am I\Nglad to see you guys whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.72,0:15:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were worried after your\Ngroup came back all but dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.40,0:15:39.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.31,0:15:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.23,0:15:43.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that By the\Nway, what's this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.36,0:15:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a magic tool with its own consciousness\Nthat I found near the lakeside.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.14,0:15:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whenever you put money in,\Nit gives you a tasty item.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.16,0:15:50.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.22,0:15:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never heard of magic tools being
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.18,0:15:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,discovered in the Clear\NFlow Lake stratum before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.16,0:15:57.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should I have not brought it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.04,0:15:59.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.02,0:16:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know how things are in the dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.20,0:16:05.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever you find lying around\Nin a stratum is yours to keep.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.72,0:16:09.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dungeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.63,0:16:11.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't really understand\Nwhat they're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.56,0:16:15.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They make it sound like we're in some\Nkind of labyrinth, but there's a sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.56,0:16:19.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you think we could\Ntry out your magic item?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.60,0:16:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, let me ask it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.22,0:16:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you mind? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.62,0:16:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, it talked!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.30,0:16:29.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, you said it had a consciousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.50,0:16:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This'd fetch a high price.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.00,0:16:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not for sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.46,0:16:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to bring him back with me\Nso Hulemy can take a look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.98,0:16:38.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That engineer who's a magic item fanatic.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:40.93,0:16:45.10,sign_2664_34_Megumi_Natural_W,text,0,0,0,,{\fs25\c&HA79D8E&\3c&HEDF0F4&}Kocha Kadan
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.76,0:16:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A silver coin, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.60,0:16:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty pricey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.02,0:16:46.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'll have one of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.06,0:16:48.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please insert coins.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:49.61,0:16:50.82,sign_1513_19_Kokuuma_Cream_of,text,0,0,0,,{\fs20\pos(205,20)\c&HCAEEEB&\3c&H2155E3&}Kokuuma Cream of Corn Soup
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.46,0:16:52.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.78,0:16:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This stuff's delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.16,0:16:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So's this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.22,0:16:57.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what this\Nfried-looking thing tastes like.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.72,0:16:58.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me try.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.92,0:17:02.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the end, they bought at\Nleast one of every item I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.08,0:17:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being able to drink both hot and\Ncold things on demand is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.70,0:17:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We aren't allowed to leave our posts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.60,0:17:10.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So could you bring it by now and again?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.70,0:17:11.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.61,0:17:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And with that, I tripled my customer base.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.42,0:17:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.92,0:17:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of your crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.02,0:17:34.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wasting our time here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.30,0:17:36.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just making things\Nworse for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.52,0:17:40.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.24,0:17:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should ask you the same,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.62,0:17:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because it looks like a bunch of nasty
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.12,0:17:45.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,-looking thugs are ganging\Nup on a helpless girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.56,0:17:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bet you think you're some\Nkind of hero, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.22,0:17:49.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This will teach you to butt in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.82,0:17:52.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got no one but\Nyourself to blame, Missy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.68,0:18:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll let you off easy,\Nbut next time you're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.50,0:18:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.92,0:18:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.94,0:18:07.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None of my hits landed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.98,0:18:09.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They didn't hurt you, did they?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.82,0:18:11.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you all right? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.64,0:18:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.68,0:18:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, missus! I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.54,0:18:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas, you made it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.02,0:18:23.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was so worried for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.84,0:18:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, missus.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.96,0:18:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Lammis, I missed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.60,0:18:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.72,0:18:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not dreaming, am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.00,0:18:33.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.92,0:18:35.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's really me, Munami.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.64,0:18:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I was afraid I'd never see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.34,0:18:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.28,0:18:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I asked the returning hunters, they\Nsaid they ran off and left you by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.98,0:18:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As revenge, I told everyone\Naround town what they did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.04,0:18:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They won't be able to find work again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.14,0:18:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, what's that? Uh?\NAh, I found it by the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.02,0:19:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lake you brought back\Nanother weird artifact
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.16,0:19:05.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one's different\Nhe's surprisingly useful
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.12,0:19:07.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and he helped me out when I was in a bind
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.72,0:19:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're going back to the\Nsurface to show it to Hulemy
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.46,0:19:18.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do you have enough for the\Ntransfer circle uh can I
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.64,0:19:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,borrow some money a transfer\Ncircle huh apparently that's
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.40,0:19:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a thing in this world also\Nllamas's lack of funds is kind
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.66,0:19:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of my fault whoops sorry\Nabout you you'll just have to
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.72,0:19:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,work at our end to earn your\Nfare how about this why don't
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.32,0:19:39.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we keep the box you found\Noutside it can sell its wares
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.18,0:19:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and attract customers hello\Nthere it really can speak
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.16,0:19:45.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.07,0:19:47.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll drum up business.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.12,0:19:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so, I found myself a new\Nhome right in front of the inn.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.80,0:19:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a sky,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.86,0:19:58.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I soon learned that this was actually\Na dungeon stratum called Clear Flow Lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.58,0:20:02.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I quickly gained popularity since my goods
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.14,0:20:04.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,were unlike anything they had seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.96,0:20:09.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, when night fell, Llamas would carry\Nme over to a safe place near the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.58,0:20:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling kind of thirsty, but\NI'm getting tired of this election.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.86,0:20:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's because you're buying\Nat least five of them every night!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.50,0:20:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose I could switch up my stock.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.46,0:20:23.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's my current status?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:24.78,0:20:30.91,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (line 1),0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(277,1)}(Cold) Mineral Water 1,000 owa 130-count\N (Warm) Corn Soup 1,000 owa 19-count\N (Cold) Milk Tea 1,000 owa 24-count\N Shaped Potato Chips 1,000 owa 36-count\N\N <Function> Keep Cold • Keep Warm\N <Blessing> Barrier
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.48,0:20:28.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all the business\NI've been getting recently,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.46,0:20:31.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like I've saved up\Nover 3,000 points. Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.18,0:20:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should I add?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.24,0:20:39.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One should always keep the customer's needs\Nin mind first I've got just the thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.04,0:20:45.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the items are different!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.94,0:20:48.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, this one costs three silver coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.44,0:20:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But at that price, it has to be good.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:48.93,0:20:51.93,sign_29945_459_Oden,text,0,0,0,,Oden
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.62,0:20:51.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.38,0:20:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How hot?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.46,0:20:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you open this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.26,0:20:58.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, are those pictures?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.98,0:21:00.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those must be instructions.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:00.69,0:21:04.57,sign_29945_459_Oden,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(528,1000)\pos(160,20)}Oden
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.06,0:21:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This item became famous in a\Ncertain electric town back home.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:04.32,0:21:08.82,sign_30314_468_How_to_enjoy_thi,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(190,20)}How to enjoy this product
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.70,0:21:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the manufacturer added meticulous\Ninstructions so even tourists could enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.54,0:21:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.24,0:21:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure smells good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.86,0:21:17.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.77,0:21:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.94,0:21:20.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It might be my new favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.72,0:21:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What ingredients did they use in this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.78,0:21:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The flavor in it is so\Ncomplex, yet incredibly light.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.32,0:21:28.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, I want alcohol now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.08,0:21:29.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scooch over a bit. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.06,0:21:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was going to buy something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.26,0:21:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're totally hooked.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.42,0:21:33.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.33,0:21:35.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got plenty more where that came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.10,0:21:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My goods only got more popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.46,0:21:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Words soon got around\Nabout the canned Odin?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.18,0:21:44.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which caused a bit of an\Nuproar in the village!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.36,0:21:48.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think the weather getting colder\Nlately might have helped sales too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.56,0:21:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's more, the sports drink I\Nadded to my stock was also selling.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.02,0:21:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't sell canned Odin during the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.34,0:21:58.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's when the restaurant\Ndoes most of its business.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.58,0:22:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I don't want to step on any toes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.14,0:22:02.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead, I help attract guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.18,0:22:10.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't this the girl Llamas saved\Nin the alley the other day?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.30,0:22:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me! Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.52,0:22:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to talk first so I'd have\Nthe advantage in negotiations!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.34,0:22:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.10,0:22:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.30,0:22:30.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the sun starts to set, Llamas\Ncarries me over to the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.28,0:22:33.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She said moving me around\Nlike before was inconvenient,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.12,0:22:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so she bought a wooden frame\Nthat she could put on her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.46,0:22:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm about to burst.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.14,0:22:42.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be heading back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.94,0:22:48.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A guest came by the inn today and\Ntold me tons of interesting stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.14,0:22:48.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.08,0:22:50.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are things on your side?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.92,0:22:52.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could even win a reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.78,0:22:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you have fun today?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.04,0:22:59.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope someday you and I can\Nhave a real conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.12,0:23:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's one of the reasons I want to hurry\Nand save up so we can go see Hulemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.64,0:23:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.38,0:23:08.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to thank me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.28,0:23:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.42,0:23:11.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were the one who saved me, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.36,0:23:13.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.27,0:23:15.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It feels kind of weird\Nto keep calling you you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.22,0:23:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think? You win!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.50,0:23:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Glad you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.04,0:23:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's to the future, Boxxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.26,0:23:27.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waking up as a vending machine in\Nanother world is as ridiculous as can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.00,0:23:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But for some reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.40,0:23:33.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to think this wouldn't\Nbe such a bad life after all.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:34.97,0:23:40.01,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,upper left text,0,0,0,,{\pos(51,65)\fs14}Next Time
Dialogue: 1,0:23:34.97,0:23:40.01,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,lower right text,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(355,290)\fs19}The King Frog Fiend Appears
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.36,0:23:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.00,0:23:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you again!

